_AQB-P6X8w3-t2-sQw_B_J4BGAWFWpUjRFfAAL2FZB7EuXQ&oe=6A6C9CE1"}, {"file_name": "ASG_SS_PatrolPartner 2.png", "id": "1449195816511930", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618512_1449195819845263_5320353852881489965_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E_C7dQm-iT8Q7kNvwHMGoMa&_nc_oc=AdovKM1dSaKN6PHGpFuw5Dxu65AsrIQmlb10efiP4ArvsFVO39tsUp-I-RC0cZpuBGY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDl-Co7muxhP3Yxk8_TzKTS1VJHlbWVZqlt2QWS8GKuCQ&oe=6A6CBA62"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ASG_2560x1440_Dog.png", "id": "26815227704753395", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618515_26815227708086728_6159149265929139896_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KrrEaHg7hUgQ7kNvwFXFX8j&_nc_oc=Adr1pnxLloUFgq_EGmwcbJMWGpmlF6r0Wq7DCyMZJFqzd1VmoMruzqsDIL-PIEhkZnQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAFNHE3SScJMg32HR0IA3xxjVdkU8r_5XFzZZLl4cEJkw&oe=6A6CAA0C"}, "display_name": "Airport Security Guard", "keywords": ["airport", "security", "guard", "chaos", "fun"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                                   \n                                                                                                                                                                                   \n                                                    \n{967463802916746}\n# NEW: Patrol Partner \ud83d\udc36\ud83d\udc3e\n\nYou\u2019re no longer handling the checkpoint alone.\n\n**Meet your Patrol Partner**\u2014a loyal K9 that helps you spot suspicious passengers, uncover hidden trouble, and stay one step ahead \u2708\ufe0f\ud83d\udd0d\nFrom sneaky smugglers to unexpected surprises, **your partner has the instincts to catch what others miss**\u2026 most of the time \ud83d\ude0f\n\n{2045802276146832}\n\n# Sabotage Tools & Kits \ud83d\ude08\ud83d\udd25\n\nChaos just got an upgrade.\n\n**Unlock powerful sabotage tools**  to disrupt rival guards, break their rhythm, and create scoring opportunities \ud83d\udca5\u2708\ufe0f\n\n**Grab Kits to combine tools and take control**\u2014from Cadet to Captain \ud83d\udc6e\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udea8\n\n{761738103289314}\n\n# Multiplayer Mode\n\nCompete with other guards, **slow down rival lines**, and **take control when it matters most** \ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udd2b\n\n{871879605880886} \n\n# Prove your skills\n\nScan passengers \ud83c\udfaf, catch smugglers \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udeab, and  **climb the leaderboard to become the top guard.**\n\n{694386776531919}\n\n# Stay sharp\n\nTime\u2019s ticking \u23f1\ufe0f\u2014**scan bags, check passengers, uncover contraband, and keep the line moving**. Miss one? **BOOM! \ud83d\udca5\u2708\ufe0f**\n\nJoin the community: **https://discord.com/invite/etermaxrstudio**                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              \n                                                                                                                                                                                     \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "BECOME A FEARLESS SECURITY GUARD AND CONTROL THE CHAOS! \ud83d\ude08\u2708\ufe0f\n\nScan fast, clear passengers, and unmask smugglers\u2014now with your Patrol Partner \ud83d\udc36\ud83d\udc3e 